al in a career that gives your ideas a global stage and makes a difference. Read more Read less Ready to apply? Read more Read less Experienced professionals Early career opportunities photo_library Gallery west east Click on the frame icon for more videos. Read more Read less Our latest thinking How blockchain is helping make every blood donation more effective Blood donations and transfusions are vital to healthcare, but tracking the journey from vein to vein in real time remains elusive. How blockchain helped a gaming platform become a game changer Microsoft Xbox and EY implemented a transparent blockchain network so game publishers, creators and asset owners can focus on the future. Deep Ghumman + 2 How COVID-19 impacted supply chains and what comes next Research shows severe disruption through the pandemic is driving enterprises to make their supply chains more resilient, collaborative and networked. Sean Harapko How digital transformation helped benefit fans and the bottom line With help from EY, the professional sports franchise was able to turn big data into even bigger value. Fran Exley Your future is our most important investment A technology career isn’t just about leading-edge innovations. It’s also about the application of these technologies to make a real, meaningful impact. That’s why we’ve collaborated with Hult International Business School to create a first-of-its-kind EY Tech MBA. Building on the EY Badges program, it helps people develop future-focused skills in areas such as big data and analytics, blockchain, AI, intelligent automation and cybersecurity. Learn more about the EY Tech MBA Previous Early careers Next Experienced professionals EY logo Connect with us Our locations Careers Webcasts My EY Site map Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information Legal and privacy Accessibility Read more Read less Open LinkedIn profile Open Instagram profile Open Facebook profile Open Youtube profile EY refers to the global organization, and may refer to 