nced professionals Early career opportunities Explore our sub-service lines Read more Read less Discover EY 360 Careers — our latest Early Careers Experience How could exploring different angles send your career to new heights? We understand that to truly excel and be happy in your career, you need the freedom to explore your interests and varied opportunities. 360 Careers is your journey through business, designed to deliver leading-class learning and immersive experiences that will allow you to shape your future with confidence. Learn more Learn more about our latest thinking Transforming the TMT treasurer from sensible to indispensable As the business landscape continues to evolve, TMT treasurers can rise to the challenge by redefining their roles and leading transformational change. Casey  Kernan + 1 When deepfake dangers cause real crises Organizations can manage AI risks by developing robust governance frameworks and using AI to detect signs of trouble. Read more. Brian Wolfe + 1 2026 Q2 Audit committee update Audit committee update: boards sharpen focus on risk, resilience, performance and reporting as AI, geopolitics and macro volatility intensify. Pat Niemann + 1 Technology solutions drive efficiency and confidence in compliance The Forensic & Integrity Pulse Series shows compliance leaders are deploying their digital approach with a focus on AI readiness. See the poll results. Gary Burke + 1 Building trust through assurance in an AI-driven world AI demands new services for assurance. Trust in AI requires frameworks for validation of data sources and to provide transparency in AI decision-making. Richard Jackson What remains in the wreckage of the Climate Disclosure Rule Climate and human capital disclosures, regulatory requirements and ESG strategies for companies Brian Tomlinson + 1 Assuring trust in an AI-driven world The adoption of AI technologies presents both opportunities and challenges, necessitating a comprehensive approach to governance and risk 