 to create long-term value for clients, people and society, and to build trust in the capital markets. Read more Read less Explore See more Read more Read less Top news Read more Read less Search search Search for insights, services and people... close search See all results for ' ' No results have been found Topics See All General See All People See All Recent Searches Trending How Novartis optimized its supply chain with real-time risk insight A data-driven, globally integrated solution helps Novartis manage high inventory, slow- and non-moving goods and audit risks. 05 Aug 2026 How AI is reshaping experience design AI is reshaping experience design. Learn how trust, human judgment and information quality drive successful AI adoption. 25 Aug 2026 Consulting Building resilient supply chains for the next era Learn how design-to-resilience, AI and digital tools help reduce supply risk and build more resilient supply chains. 31 Aug 2026 Geostrategy My EY My EY Select your location Local sites Experienced professionals | Early careers | What it’s like to work here | Application process Read more Read less Careers in EY-Parthenon Your impact starts here Are you ready to take on the strategic challenges that define how the world’s leading organizations grow, compete and transform? Read more Read less You’ll collaborate with CEOs, boards, private equity and governments on the decisions that matter most. You’ll work across mergers and acquisitions, capital raising and financial restructuring, bringing real insight to high-impact projects across every major industry. With deep sector experience, AI-powered technology and an investor mindset behind you, you’ll deliver solutions that create lasting, measurable value. Read more Read less Ready to apply? Read more Read less Experienced professionals Early career opportunities Explore our sub-service lines Read more Read less Strategy & Execution Setting and executing a strategy to create and optimize value has never been more challenging, with our professionals continually answering the “what” and “how” questions on the CEO agenda. From strategy consulting to M&A advisory, you’ll be involved in some of the leading work in the industry. Read more Read less Deals We work with CEOs, boards, private equity and governments to shape high-impact M&A strategy. Our transactions teams work on activities such as financial due diligence, transaction analysis and divestitures, helping to execute industry-leading deals. Read more Read less Corporate Finance Our teams play a key role in business transformation. From valuation, modeling and economics to portfolio optimization, we help businesses drive sustainable value for all stakeholders — making sure that everything we do drives impact and value, for us and our clients. Read more Read less EY-Parthenon careers Our unique combination of transformative strategy, transactions, tax and corporate finance delivers real-world value – solutions that work in practice, not just on paper. Explore our early career opportunities Read more Read less Associate Program Undergraduate and master’s degree candidates Ideal for undergraduates and master’s degree students, gain a diversity of experience across sectors and engagement types as you work with clients to navigate strategic challenges — helping them reimagine their ecosystems, reshape their portfolios and reinvent themselves for a better future. Read more Read less Explore more Consultant Program MBA candidates Designed for MBAs, this program gives you exposure to a variety of opportunities that help you to develop the well-rounded strategic skill set that’s essential to becoming a transformative business leader. Read more Read less Explore more Case studies Read more Read less Our latest thinking Global Economic Outlook: risk and opportunity in a supply shock world 2026 Midyear Global Economic Outlook: risk and opportunity in a supply shock world Gregory Daco How do CEOs reimagine enterprises for a future that keeps rewriting itself? EY-Parthenon CEO Outlook 2026 explores how leaders use AI, transformation and portfolio strategy to navigate uncertainty and drive sustainable growth. Andrea Guerzoni + 2 How neurosymbolic AI finds growth that others cannot see Artificial intelligence should help companies grow, not just be efficient. Neurosymbolic AI is the AI platform for a company’s growth strategy. Jeff Schumacher Previous Next Previous What it’s like to work here Next How to join us EY Parthenon footer logo Read more Read less Our locations Connect with us Legal and privacy Read more Read less Open LinkedIn profile Open Instagram profile Open Facebook profile Open Youtube profile EY refers to the global organization, and may refer to one or more, of the member firms of Ernst & Young Global Limited, each of which is a separate legal entity. Ernst & Young Global Limited, a UK company limited by guarantee, does not provide services to clients. For more information about our organization, please visit ey.com. EY-Parthenon is a brand under which a number of EY member firms across the globe provide strategy consulting services. Welcome to EY us (en) You are visiting EY us (en) us en"
