 2||## 3||## 4||## 5||## 6||## 7||## 8||## 9||## 10||## Read more Read less Spotlight Read more Read less Artificial Intelligence (AI) Strategy, Transaction & Transformation Audit Tax Function Operations Climate Change & Sustainability EY Partner Ecosystem Technology Transformation Supply Chain & Operations Read more Read less Industries Read more Read less Discover how EY insights and services are helping to reframe the future of your industry. Read more Read less Explore 1||## 2||## 3||## 4||## 5||## 6||## 7||## 8||## 9||## Read more Read less Case studies Read more Read less Power Utilities How digital twin technology powers the future at Xcel Energy 28 Aug 2025 Subbu Natarajan Strategy and Transactions How Bristol Myers Squibb overhauled working capital to fund its future 20 Aug 2025 Gerado Gonzalez Alliances How St James’s Hospital's journey to cloud transformed cancer care 09 Jun 2025 EY Americas Insights Read more Read less Asking the better questions that unlock new answers to the working world's most complex issues. Read more Read less Explore Trending topics Read more Read less See more Read more Read less Insights Spotlight Read more Read less Case studies Webcasts Podcasts Read more Read less C-Suite Spotlight Read more Read less CEO Agenda CFO Agenda Operations Leaders Technology Leaders Marketing & Growth Leaders Cybersecurity & Privacy Leaders Risk Leaders EY Center for Board Matters Read more Read less About us Read more Read less At EY, our purpose is building a better working world. The insights and services we provide help to create long-term value for clients, people and society, and to build trust in the capital markets. Read more Read less Explore See more Read more Read less Top news Read more Read less Careers Read more Read less We bring together extraordinary people, like you, to build a better working world. Read more Read less Explore See more 1||More about what you can do here 2||More about what it's like to work here 3||More about how to join us 4||More about job search Read more Read less Spotlight Read more Read less Experienced professionals Early career opportunities MBA and advanced-degree students Contract workers EY-Parthenon careers Read more Read less Search search Search for insights, services and people... close search See all results for ' ' No results have been found Topics See All General See All People See All Recent Searches Trending How Novartis optimized its supply chain with real-time risk insight A data-driven, globally integrated solution helps Novartis manage high inventory, slow- and non-moving goods and audit risks. 05 Aug 2026 How AI is reshaping experience design AI is reshaping experience design. Learn how trust, human judgment and information quality drive successful AI adoption. 25 Aug 2026 Consulting Building resilient supply chains for the next era Learn how design-to-resilience, AI and digital tools help reduce supply risk and build more resilient supply chains. 31 Aug 2026 Geostrategy My EY My EY Select your location Local sites Experienced professionals | Early careers | What it’s like to work here | Application process Read more Read less Careers in Tax Bring your depth of knowledge and help businesses scale new heights Tax is a truly strategic function for businesses, which means the role of the tax professional has never been more important – or more rewarding – especially in today’s disruptive environment. Read more Read less Working in EY Tax is your opportunity to join a community of more than 10,000 EY tax practitioners in the US – helping clients thrive in this era of rapid change. Tax combines exceptional knowledge and experience with the best people and technology platforms, providing you with the perfect environment for career growth. Read more Read less Ready to apply? Read more Read less Experienced professionals Early career opportunities Explore our sub-service lines Read more Read less Accessibility description Hide description Business Tax Services (BTS): In BTS, you'll be immersed in market-leading business tax services and solutions we provide to our clients. The team puts a strong focus on innovation to anticipate and support client needs. By bringing different people and skills together, BTS deploys highly effective problem-solving capabilities to navigate business tax challenges. Global Compliance & Reporting (GCR): In GCR, you'll help companies gain more control, efficiency and value in their tax and finance, so they can be more focused on business strategy. Our standardized and cohesive approach allows our teams to deliver greater efficiencies, identify broader opportunities for other services and support our clients' transformation journeys. Law: Our Law professionals navigate the complexity of tax, regulatory and commercial laws in today's economy. You'll be contributing to our multidisciplinary approach, which delivers expert, integrated advice to help reduce the gap between business advisors and legal counsel. International Tax and Transaction Services (ITTS): Working in ITTS is an opportunity to advise companies and private equity investors on the tax aspects of transactions. It's a dynamic and highly commercial environment, working across a wide range of industries and geographies. You'll help clients benefit from potential tax opportunities, while reducing tax risk. Indirect Tax: Our Indirect Tax team works with clients that trade goods or services nationally and internationally. You'll advise on how indirect taxes, such as value-added tax (VAT) or goods and services tax (GST), impact your clients' supply chain, customs requirements and financial and accounting systems – identifying and managing risk. People Advisory Services (PAS) – Tax: From HR professionals to tech advisors, employment regulation consultants and more, People Advisory Services helps clients improve and harness their people. If you share our belief that people are the key to success, you could soon be helping clients transform the way they work – and helping us build a better working world. Tax Technology and Transformation: Changes to finance and tax, from regulatory and legislative enforcement to market pressures and supply chain challenges, are now organizational imperatives, and technology and data is where it starts. TTT leverages our broad network of talented and experienced professionals supported by an ecosystem of alliances and agile commercial and proprietary technologies to offer rapid delivery and supports our client's most urgent transformational needs. Discover EY 360 Careers — our latest Early Careers Experience How could exploring different angles send your career to new heights? We understand that to truly excel and be happy in your career, you need the freedom to explore your interests and varied opportunities. 360 Careers is your journey through business, designed to deliver leading-class learning and immersive experiences that will allow you to shape your future with confidence. Learn more Our latest thinking What if building trust helped global mobility thrive at the speed of change? Global workforce mobility functions must move talent at the speed of business. Learn why building a trust infrastructure can spur market momentum. Gerard Osei-Bonsu + 2 How transparency is transforming the global tax landscape This episode discusses AI, data governance, BEPS, and global cooperation with EY leaders and the OECD’s Manal Corwin. Listen now. 30m 9s How agentic AI can reshape your tax function Discover how agentic AI empowers tax functions, automating complex tasks for accuracy, efficiency, and opening new strategic possibilities. Learn more. EY Americas Five policy areas to watch in the House-passed tax bill Key business, energy, and international tax changes to monitor as Senate deliberations begin. EY Americas Hear from our Tax professionals Read more Read less photo_library Gallery west east Click on the frame icon for more videos. Read more Read less Previous Early caree